WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.152
Dum, dum, ta-dum!

2
00:00:07.153 --> 00:00:14.045
Hob was playing his new drum.

3
00:00:14.046 --> 00:00:19.248
Bumble put his hands on his ears. "Stop that noise!

4
00:00:19.249 --> 00:00:22.803
I'm reading the training book!"

5
00:00:22.804 --> 00:00:26.921
"Musicians have to practice," Hob said.

6
00:00:26.922 --> 00:00:30.103
He banged his drum again.

7
00:00:30.104 --> 00:00:34.076
"Please practice somewhere else, Hob," Feather said.

8
00:00:34.077 --> 00:00:37.551
"You're giving me a headache."

9
00:00:37.552 --> 00:00:44.467
Hob sighed. "Nobody likes good music."

10
00:00:44.468 --> 00:00:47.433
Sprite flew over and grabbed a drumstick.

11
00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:54.009
She tossed it in the grass. "We love good music.

12
00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:57.466
But you're not making any!"

13
00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:03.117
"Hmpf!" Hob flew over to get his drumstick.

14
00:01:03.118 --> 00:01:05.912
"Someday I'll be a great musician.

15
00:01:05.913 --> 00:01:09.033
Then you'll all be sorry!"

16
00:01:09.034 --> 00:01:11.863
He went back to playing.

17
00:01:11.864 --> 00:01:18.254
"I'm leaving," Feather said. "I can't stand this noise."

18
00:01:18.255 --> 00:01:26.236
"Me too!" Bumble and Sprite said, following her.

19
00:01:26.237 --> 00:01:32.531
"Hob," Sprite called over her shoulder.

20
00:01:32.532 --> 00:01:35.819
"Watch for wish smoke."

21
00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:44.260
Hob nodded and kept drumming.

22
00:01:44.261 --> 00:01:48.459
"It's nice to practice alone," he thought.

23
00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:53.605
"Nobody is complaining anymore."

24
00:01:53.606 --> 00:02:13.524
Hob played a new tune. Bang, boom, bong!

25
00:02:13.525 --> 00:02:22.254
He played for a long time.

26
00:02:22.255 --> 00:02:25.908
"Oops!" Suddenly Hob realized something.

27
00:02:25.909 --> 00:02:28.887
Wish smoke was swirling around him.

28
00:02:28.888 --> 00:02:33.155
Hob spun in circles as the smoke surrounded him.

29
00:02:33.156 --> 00:02:37.672
"Oh no!" Hob groaned.

30
00:02:37.673 --> 00:02:40.140
He read a name: Mark.

31
00:02:40.141 --> 00:02:46.777
But he could read only three other letters: r . . . u . . . m.

32
00:02:46.778 --> 00:02:49.817
Soon the letters faded.

33
00:02:49.818 --> 00:02:52.065
"Hob!" Feather cried.

34
00:02:52.066 --> 00:02:55.131
The other fairies flew toward him.

35
00:02:55.132 --> 00:02:58.537
"Why didn't you tell us about the wish smoke?"

36
00:02:58.538 --> 00:03:04.202
"Come on! Before it disappears!" Sprite yelled.

37
00:03:04.203 --> 00:03:11.760
The fairies raced after the last wisps of smoke.

38
00:03:11.761 --> 00:03:14.720
Bumble panted as they flew.

39
00:03:14.721 --> 00:03:20.241
"Hob, what did the wish say?" he asked.

40
00:03:20.242 --> 00:03:24.857
"What does the birthday child want?" Feather asked.

41
00:03:24.858 --> 00:03:32.667
"Er . . ." Hob gulped and hugged his drum.

42
00:03:32.668 --> 00:03:35.949
He thought of the three letters.

43
00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:39.448
Then it came to him.

44
00:03:39.449 --> 00:03:42.406
Hob grinned at the other fairies.

45
00:03:42.407 --> 00:03:44.862
"Mark has the right idea.

46
00:03:44.863 --> 00:03:55.550
He wished for a new drum!"

